` Strings are enclosed in backticks `
` Non-evaluating single literal lines are ignored. `

` Variables and Literals `
x : -353.15134
y : 4001.35364502

hex_val : 0xAF8534
bin_val : 0b00101001
regA : 0rA
uni_a : 0u3042  ` Unicode 'あ' `

Hello : `Hello`
World : `World`

` Truthy values are valid non-Unit values. Falsey values are empty lists or Unit __ `
yep : 0
nop : _

none : _
unit : _
id : _

` Comparison operations `
[x < 4] = [x < 4 & x]
[x = 4] = [x == 4 & x]

` Ternary Comparison Chaining `
[1 <= x <= 9] = [[x >= 1] & [x <= 9]]

` Functions and Lambdas `
[x y ? (x + y) ^ 2]

` Point-free and function composition `
[+] [^ 2]

` Explicit address retrieval for higher-order function arguments `
Filter : f x ~y ? @f x , Filter f y~
Filter $[> 0] [-2 ~ 3]

` Conditional match_case expression `
[ x ?
	x = 0 : 0
	x > 0 : `more`
	x < 0 : `less`
	`otherwise`
] 3

` Dict and Struct definitions `
#MyGame :
	State :
		Existence
		Durability

#Mob : MyGame~
	Base : State~
	State~

` Logical short-circuit `
_ & `me` = _
1 & `me` = `me`
_ | `me` = `me`
1 | `me` = 1
